\/2","Conjuction":"And","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">And<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Please indicate how often you use each of the following transport modes to commute between your home address and your primary ASML work location during a typical work week.<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\"> - 1x a week<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Less Than or Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 5 <\/span>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID12\/SelectedAnswerCount\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"LessThanOrEqual","QuestionID":"QID12","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID12","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","RightOperand":"5","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"No custom message specified","libraryID":"UR_5yymHoZtv4LJF6S","messageID":"MS_Wk1PGKOdew6mQG7","subMessageID":"VE_CUSTOM_VALIDATION_NO_MESSAGE"}}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":12,"NextAnswerId":9,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"0x a week"},"2":{"Display":"1x a week"},"3":{"Display":"2x a week"},"4":{"Display":"3x a week"},"5":{"Display":"4x a week"},"6":{"Display":"5x a week"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,"6"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionID":"QID12","AnswerColumns":5,"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n  const colIndex = 1; \/\/ 1 = first column\n  this.questionContainer.querySelectorAll('tr.ChoiceRow').forEach(row => {\n    const radios = row.querySelectorAll('input[type=\"radio\"]');\n    if (radios[colIndex - 1]) {\n      radios[colIndex - 1].checked = true;\n    }\n  });\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219833319","SecondaryAttribute":"You will be presented with 8\u00a0hypothetical situations\/tables. Your responses help us gain better i..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>You will be presented with<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> <\/b><b>8&nbsp;hypothetical situations\/tables.<\/b> Your responses help us gain better insight into which factors are most important to you during your commute, as well as the trade-offs you make between different transport options.&nbsp;Changes from the previous table are highlighted <span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">in blue<\/span> for easy comparison.<\/p>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Note:&nbsp;<\/em><\/span> <span style=\"font-size:13px;\"> <em>The number shown at the start of each question does <strong>not<\/strong> indicate the order of the questions or how many questions you will see. It simply refers to the randomly assigned scenario you are presented with.<\/em><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You will be presented with 8\u00a0hypothetical situations\/tables. Your responses help us gain better i...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Block 6A","DataExportTag":"Q1","QuestionID":"QID1219833319"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219833320","SecondaryAttribute":"(1) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>(1)<\/strong> Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Car<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>P+R<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Vanpool<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>(e)-Bicycle<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID15\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${e:\/\/Field\/PR_time} min <span title=\"This time represents your Commuter allowance time from your home address to your ASML work location. It includes your trip from home to the P+R location and from the P+R location to work.\"> <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/vp_time} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Commuter allowance<br>\n\t\t\t(one way)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\