for 4 years<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nYou will <strong>still be allowed to park at all Park and Ride (P+R) locations!<\/strong>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>In return, you can choose <strong>one of the following&nbsp;<\/strong>rewards:<\/p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>A free <b>e\u2011bike<\/b> worth \u20ac2,000<\/li>\n\t<li>A free home <b>EV charging station<\/b><\/li>\n\t<li><b>Unlimited <\/b>public transport (including private trips)<\/li>\n\t<li>\u20ac2,000 <b>cash <\/b>(gross<b>)<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<div><br>\nBased on the <b>same scenario shown in the table above,<\/b> would you accept this offer?<\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer. If you accept this offer, you give up your...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833321\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Car<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833321\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833321","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833321","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833321\/SelectableChoice\/2","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">P+R<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833321\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833321","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833321","QuestionIsInLoop":"n