all Park and Ride (P+R) locations!<\/strong>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>In return, you can choose <strong>one of the following&nbsp;<\/strong>rewards:<\/p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>A free <b>e\u2011bike<\/b> worth \u20ac2,000<\/li>\n\t<li>A free home <b>EV charging station<\/b><\/li>\n\t<li><b>Unlimited <\/b>public transport (including private trips)<\/li>\n\t<li>\u20ac2,000 <b>cash <\/b>(gross<b>)<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<div><br>\nBased on the <b>same scenario shown in the table above,<\/b> would you accept this offer?<\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer. If you accept this offer, you give up your...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Car<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833354","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833354","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/2","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">P+R<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833354","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833354","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"2":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/3","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Vanpool<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833354","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833354","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"3":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/4","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Public Transport<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/4","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833354","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833354","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"4":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/5","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">(e)-Bicycle<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833354\/SelectableChoice\/5","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833354","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833354","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":true},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Now imagine ASML introduces a <strong>voluntary program<\/strong> where you can <strong>choose to give up your right to park<\/strong> on the ASML campus <strong>for 3 years<\/strong> <em>(you would still be allowed to park at the P+R locations!).<\/em>&nbsp;In exchange, you can request <b>one <\/b>of the following rewards:<br><br>\n1. A free <b>e\u2011bike<\/b> worth \u20ac2,000\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n2. A free home <b>EV charging station\n\n<\/b><div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n3. <b>Unlimited <\/b>public transport (including private trips)<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n4. \u20ac2,000 <b>cash <\/b>(gross<b>)\n\n<\/b><div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n\n<div><br>\nBased on the<u> <b>same scenario in the table above<\/b><\/u>, would you be willing to give up your parking rights for 3 years (<em>not including right to park at P+R locations<\/em>)?<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q4","QuestionID":"QID1219833355"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219833356","SecondaryAttribute":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose t...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose to commute to ASML?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose t...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"P+R"},"2":{"Display":"Vanpool"},"3":{"Display":"Public Transport"},"4":{"Display":"(e-)Bicycle"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219833355\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer.\n\nIf you accept this offer, you give up your right to park on the ASML campus for 4 years.\n\nYou will still be allowed to park at all Park and Ri...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Yes<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219833355\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219833355","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219833355","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":true},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose to commute to ASML?","DataExportTag":"Q5","QuestionID":"QID1219833356"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219833357","SecondaryAttribute":"(4) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>(4)<\/strong> Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Car<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>P+R<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Vanpool<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">(e)-Bicycle<\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px sol