19840025","SecondaryAttribute":"Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer. If you accept this offer, you give up your...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Now imagine ASML makes the following <strong>voluntary offer.<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nIf you accept this offer, you give up your <strong>right to park on the ASML campus for 4 years<\/strong>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nYou will <strong>still be allowed to park at all Park and Ride (P+R) locations!<\/strong>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>In return, you can choose <strong>one of the following&nbsp;<\/strong>rewards:<\/p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>A free <b>e\u2011bike<\/b> worth &euro;2,000<\/li>\n\t<li>A free home <b>EV charging station<\/b><\/li>\n\t<li><b>Unlimited <\/b>public transport (including private trips)<\/li>\n\t<li>&euro;2,000 <b>cash <\/b>(gross<b>)<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<div><br \/>\nBased on the <b>same scenario shown in the table above,<\/b> would you accept this offer?<\/div>","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer. If you accept this offer, you give up your...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219840024\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"Error\">Invalid Logic<\/span> <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" clickcallback=\"Qualtrics.DisplayLogic.edit:DL_19092707\" instanceid=\"LE_72923359\">Click Here to Edit Logic<\/a>","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219840024\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219840024","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219840024","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219840024\/SelectableChoice\/2","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"Error\">Invalid Logic<\/span> <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" clickcall