ds:<br><br>\n1. A free <b>e\u2011bike<\/b> worth \u20ac2,000\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n2. A free home <b>EV charging station\n\n<\/b><div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n3. <b>Unlimited <\/b>public transport (including private trips)<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n4. \u20ac2,000 <b>cash <\/b>(gross<b>)\n\n<\/b><div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n\n<div><br>\nBased on the<u> <b>same scenario in the table above<\/b><\/u>, would you be willing to give up your parking rights for 3 years (<em>not including right to park at P+R locations<\/em>)?<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q20","QuestionID":"QID1219840041"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219840042","SecondaryAttribute":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose t...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose to commute to ASML?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose t...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Vanpool"},"2":{"Display":"Public Transport"}},"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219840041\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer.\n\nIf you accept this offer, you give up your right to park on the ASML campus for 3 years.\n\nYou will still be allowed to park at all Park and Ri...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Yes<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219840041\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID121