:"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose to commute to ASML?","DataExportTag":"Q33","QuestionID":"QID1219841382"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219841383","SecondaryAttribute":"You will be presented with 8\u00a0hypothetical situations\/tables. Your responses help us gain better i..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>You will be presented with<b style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> <\/b><b>8&nbsp;hypothetical situations\/tables.<\/b> Your responses help us gain better insight into which factors are most important to you during your commute, as well as the trade-offs you make between different transport options.&nbsp;Changes from the previous table are highlighted <span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">in blue<\/span> for easy comparison.<\/p>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Note:&nbsp;<\/em><\/span> <span style=\"font-size:13px;\"> <em>The number shown at the start of each question does <strong>not<\/strong> indicate the order of the questions or how many questions you will see. It simply refers to the randomly assigned scenario you are presented with.<\/em><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You will be presented with 8\u00a0hypothetical situations\/tables. Your responses help us gain better i...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Block 6B","DataExportTag":"Q1","QuestionID":"QID1219841383"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219841384","SecondaryAttribute":"(1) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>(1)<\/strong> Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Car<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>P+R<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID15\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${e:\/\/Field\/PR_time} min <span title=\"This time represents your Commuter allowance time from your home address to your ASML work location. It includes your trip from home to the P+R location and from the P+R location to work.\"> <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Commuter allowance<br>\n\t\t\t(one way)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">\u20ac 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br>\n\t\t\tcost<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">- \u20ac 3.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">\u20ac 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br>\n\t\t\treservation<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span title=\"Commuters living more than 20 km away can reserve starting 1 week before. Those living 20 km or closer can only reserve starting 24 hours before.\">Priority system <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><span title=\"No reservation system in place.\">None <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br>\n\t\t\tguaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/ParkingGuaranteed}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">Yes<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">P+R<br>\n\t\t\treward<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ \u20ac 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"(1) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><strong>(1)<\/strong> Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Car<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>P+R<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Vanpool<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>(e)-Bicycle<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID15\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; b