ime} min <span title=\"This time represents your Commuter allowance time from your home address to your ASML work location. It includes your trip from home to the P+R location and from the P+R location to work.\"> <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Commuter allowance<br \/>\n\t\t\t(one way)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">&euro; 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\tcost<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- &euro; 1.50<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\treservation<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span title=\"Reservations open from 1 week in advance for everyone.\">Standard system <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><span title=\"No reservation system in place.\">None <i style=\"m