rong>voluntary program<\/strong> where you can <strong>choose to give up your right to park<\/strong> on the ASML campus <strong>for 3 years<\/strong> <em>(you would still be allowed to park at the P+R locations!).<\/em>&nbsp;In exchange, you can request <b>one <\/b>of the following rewards:<br><br>\n1. A free <b>e\u2011bike<\/b> worth \u20ac2,000\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n2. A free home <b>EV charging station\n\n<\/b><div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n3. <b>Unlimited <\/b>public transport (including private trips)<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n4. \u20ac2,000 <b>cash <\/b>(gross<b>)\n\n<\/b><div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><\/div>\n\n<div><br>\nBased on the<u> <b>same scenario in the table above<\/b><\/u>, would you be willing to give up your parking rights for 3 years (<em>not including right to park at P+R locations<\/em>)?<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q32","QuestionID":"QID1219841837"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219841838","SecondaryAttribute":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose t...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose to commute to ASML?","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose t...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"P+R"},"2":{"Display":"(e)-Bicycle"},"3":{"Display":"Public Transport"}},"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219841837\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer.\n\nIf you accept this offer, you give up your right to park on the ASML campus for 3 years.\n\nYou will still be allowed to park at all Park and Ri...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Yes<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219841837\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219841837","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219841837","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":true},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Having given up your parking right in the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose to commute to ASML?","DataExportTag":"Q33","QuestionID":"QID1219841838"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1219843771","SecondaryAttribute":"You will be presented with\u00a08\u00a0hypothetical situations\/tables. Your responses help us gain better i.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>You will be presented with&nbsp;<b>8&nbsp;hypothetical situations\/tables.<\/b> Your responses help us gain better insight into which factors are most important to you during your commute, as well as the trade-offs you make between different transport options.&nbsp;Changes from the previous table are highlighted <span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">in blue<\/span> for easy comparison.<\/p>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Note:&nbsp;<\/em><\/span> <span style=\"font-size:13px;\"> <em>The number shown at the start of each question does <strong>not<\/strong> indicate the order of the questions or how many questions you will see. It simply refers to the randomly assigned scenario you are presented with.<\/em><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescript