...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219843839\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Car<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219843839\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219843839","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219843839","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219843839\/SelectableChoice\/2","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">P+R<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219843839\/SelectableChoice\/2","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219843839","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219843839","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"2":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219843839\/SelectableChoice\/3","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Vanpool<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID1219843839\/SelectableChoice\/3","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID1219843839","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID1219843839","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"3":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID1219843839\/SelectableChoice\/4","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Public Transport<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">