pan><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><span title=\"No reservation system in place.\">None <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\tguaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/ParkingGuaranteed}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">Yes<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">P+R<br \/>\n\t\t\treward<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">+ &euro; 0.00<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Emergency<br \/>\n\t\t\ttaxi guaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">No<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Vanpool<br \/>\n\t\t\tdepartures<br \/>\n\t\t\tper hour<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">2x per hour<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"(24) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likel...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p><strong>(24)<\/strong> Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>Car<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><strong>P+R<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>Vanpool<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><strong>Public Transport<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>(e)-Bicycle<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td st