 (e-)Bicycle Time \u00a0${q:\/\/QID21\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} \u00a0${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50;\"><strong>Vanpool<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50;\"><strong>(e-)Bicycle<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Time<\/h4>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;${q:\/\/QID21\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q26","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\u00a0 Vanpool (e-)Bicycle Time \u00a0${q:\/\/QID21\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} \u00a0${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID26"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID27","SecondaryAttribute":"Example commute choice \u00a0 Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part o..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><br \/>\nExample commute choice<\/h1>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part of the survey. It shows how different commute options are compared.<\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\nYou do not need to make a choice here yet.<\/p>\n\n<h2><br \/>\nImportant note<\/h2>\n<br \/>\nPlease keep in mind that<strong><em> the table does not include every possible cost or benefit associated with each travel option<\/em><\/strong>. For example, fuel costs are not shown. When choosing options like the vanpool, you may save money on fuel or other personal travel expenses, even though these are not displayed in the table.<br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Vanpool<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/vp_time} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Commuter allowance<br \/>\n\t\t\t(one way)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Emergency<br \/>\n\t\t\ttaxi guaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">Yes<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Vanpool<br \/>\n\t\t\tdepartures<br \/>\n\t\t\tper hour<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">2<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\nIf you want more information on the exact definitions of the transport modes and variables, you can click the tab below:<br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" id=\"moreInfoToggle\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Click here for more information \u25bc <\/a><\/h3>\n\n<div id=\"moreInfoContent\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px;\">\n<p><strong>Transport modes in the table<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>The transport mode shown in the table refers to the main part of your commute, meaning the mode you use for the longest or most important part of the trip to campus.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Vanpool:<\/strong> Traveling mainly by a shared, professionally driven van that is exclusively available to ASML employees.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Public transport:<\/strong> Traveling mainly by scheduled public transport, such as bus or train. This includes any walking or cycling needed to reach or leave stops or stations.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Fixed characteristics<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>These characteristics are based on the information you provided earlier in the survey. They stay the same within a table and across questions.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Time:<\/strong> The estimated time from your home to campus for each commute option. This estimate is based on your earlier answers.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Commuter allowance\n(one way):<\/strong> The commuting reimbursement you receive for traveling by car or bicycle. This amount is calculated using the distance you provided earlier.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Variable characteristics<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>These characteristics differ between commute options and may also change from one question to another. They describe differences in costs, conditions, or additional benefits.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Emergency taxi guaranteed:<\/strong> Indicates whether an emergency taxi is provided and paid for if you need to leave immediately and the vanpool departure times do not align with your situation.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Vanpool departures per hour:<\/strong> Shows how many vanpool trips depart each hour. A higher number means shorter waiting times and more flexibility.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q27","QuestionID":"QID27","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Example commute choice \u00a0 Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part o...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n\n  var toggle = document.getElementById(\"moreInfoToggle\");\n  var content = document.getElementById(\"moreInfoContent\");\n\n  if (toggle && content) {\n    toggle.onclick = function() {\n      if (content.style.display === \"none\") {\n        content.style.display = \"block\";\n        toggle.innerHTML = \"More information \u25b2\";\n      } else {\n        content.style.display = \"none\";\n        toggle.innerHTML = \"More information \u25bc\";\n      }\n    };\n  }\n\n});\n\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID28","SecondaryAttribute":"Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely cho...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50;\"><strong>Vanpool<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50;\"><strong>(e-)Bicycle<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Time<\/h4>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID21\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q28","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely cho...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID28"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID29","SecondaryAttribute":"Example commute choice \u00a0 Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part o..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><br \/>\nExample commute choice<\/h1>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part of the survey. It shows how different commute options are compared.<\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\nYou do not need to make a choice here yet.<\/p>\n\n<h2><br \/>\nImportant note<\/h2>\n<br \/>\nPlease keep in mind that<strong><em> the table does not include every possible cost or benefit associated with each travel option<\/em><\/strong>. For example, fuel costs are not shown. When choosing options like the vanpool, you may save money on fuel or other personal travel expenses, even though these are not displayed in the table.<br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Vanpool<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>(e)-Bicycle<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/vp_time} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Total travel<br \/>\n\t\t\tallowance<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/bike_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Emergency<br \/>\n\t\t\ttaxi guaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">Yes<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Vanpool<br \/>\n\t\t\tdepartures<br \/>\n\t\t\tper hour<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">2<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\nFor the exact definitions of the transport modes and variables, you can click the tab below:\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" id=\"moreInfoToggle\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Click here for more information \u25bc <\/a><\/h3>\n\n<div id=\"moreInfoContent\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px;\">\n<p><strong>Transport modes in the table<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>The transport mode shown in the table refers to the main part of your commute, meaning the mode you use for the longest or most important part of the trip to campus.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Vanpool:<\/strong> Traveling mainly by a shared, professionally driven van that is exclusively available to ASML employees.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Public transport:<\/strong> Traveling mainly by scheduled public transport, such as bus or train. This includes any walking or cycling needed to reach or leave stops or stations.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>(e)-Bicycle:<\/strong> Traveling mainly by bicycle or electric bicycle for the commute.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Fixed characteristics<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>These characteristics are based on the information you provided earlier in the survey. They stay the same within a table and across questions.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Time:<\/strong> The estimated total travel time from your home to campus for each commute option. This estimate is based on your earlier answers.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Total travel allowance:<\/strong> The commuting reimbursement you receive for traveling by car or bicycle. This amount is calculated using the distance you provided earlier.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Variable characteristics<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>These characteristics differ between commute options and may also change from one question to another. They describe differences in costs, conditions, or additional benefits.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Emergency taxi guaranteed:<\/strong> Indicates whether an emergency taxi is provided and paid for if you need to leave immediately and the vanpool departure times do not align with your situation.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Vanpool departures per hour:<\/strong> Shows how many vanpool trips depart each hour. A higher number means shorter waiting times and more flexibility.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q29","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Example commute choice \u00a0 Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part o...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID29","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n\n  var toggle = document.getElementById(\"moreInfoToggle\");\n  var content = document.getElementById(\"moreInfoContent\");\n\n  if (toggle && content) {\n    toggle.onclick = function() {\n      if (content.style.display === \"none\") {\n        content.style.display = \"block\";\n        toggle.innerHTML = \"More information \u25b2\";\n      } else {\n        content.style.display = \"none\";\n        toggle.innerHTML = \"More information \u25bc\";\n      }\n    };\n  }\n\n});\n\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID3","SecondaryAttribute":"What is the approximate distance, in kilometers, between your home address and your primary ASML...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What is the approximate distance, in <b>kilometers<\/b>, between your home address and your primary ASML work location?<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Note: <\/em><\/span> <span style=\"font-size:13px;\"> <em>Your ASML\u2011calculated distance can be found in <b>MyCommute <\/b>and is used to determine your commuter allowance (one way).<\/em><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q1.3","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"What is the approximate distance, in kilometers, between your home address and your primary ASML...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"ContentType","MinChars":"1","ContentType":"ValidNumber","ValidDateType":"DateWithFormat","ValidPhoneType":"ValidUSPhone","ValidZipType":"ValidUSZip","ValidNumber":{"Min":"0","Max":"","NumDecimals":""},"AITextAnalysis":{"Checks":[{"Messages":"default","Type":"Partial"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"OverlyGeneralized"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"NonInsightful"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"InsufficientDetail"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"Gibberish"}]}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionID":"QID3","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n\n  const q = this.questionContainer;\n  const input = q.querySelector('input[type=\"text\"]');\n  if (!input) return;\n\n  \/* ----- outer wrapper (vertical layout) ----- *\/\n  const outer = document.createElement('div');\n  outer.style.display = 'flex';\n  outer.style.flexDirection = 'column';\n  outer.style.alignItems = 'flex-start';\n\n  input.parentNode.insertBefore(outer, input);\n\n  \/* ----- row for input + unit ----- *\/\n  const row = document.createElement('div');\n  row.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n  row.style.alignItems = 'center';\n  row.style.gap = '8px';\n\n  outer.appendChild(row);\n  row.appendChild(input);\n\n  const unit = document.createElement('span');\n  unit.textContent = 'kilometers'; \/\/ change if needed\n  unit.style.fontSize = '14px';\n\n  row.appendChild(unit);\n\n  \/* ----- note BELOW the answer box ----- *\/\n  const note = document.createElement('div');\n  note.textContent = 'Enter a single number (for example: 25).';\n  note.style.fontSize = '12px';\n  note.style.color = '#555';\n  note.style.marginTop = '6px';\n\n  outer.appendChild(note);\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});\n\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnPageSubmit(function() {\n\n    \/\/ --- Read the commute distance from QID3 ---\n    var val = parseFloat(document.getElementById(\"QR~QID3\").value);\n\n    \/\/ ---------------------------\n    \/\/ BIKE ALLOWANCE\n    \/\/ ---------------------------\n    var bikeResult;\n    if (!isNaN(val) && val <= 20) {\n        bikeResult = val * 0.35;\n    } else {\n        bikeResult = 7.00;\n    }\n    var bikeFormatted = \"\u20ac\" + bikeResult.toFixed(2);\n    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"bike_allowance\", bikeFormatted);\n\n\n    \n\/\/ ---------------------------\n\/\/ CAR ALLOWANCE\n\/\/ ---------------------------\nvar carResult = 0;\n\nif (!isNaN(val) && val >= 10.1) {\n\n    \/\/ Cap the reimbursed kilometers at 20\n    var kmForReimbursement = Math.min(val, 20);\n\n    carResult = kmForReimbursement * 0.21;\n}\n\nvar carFormatted = \"\u20ac\" + carResult.toFixed(2);\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"car_allowance\", carFormatted);\n\t\n\t\n    \/\/ ---------------------------\n    \/\/ DISTANCE ABOVE 20 KM (YES \/ NO)\n    \/\/ ---------------------------\n    if (!isNaN(val) && val > 20) {\n        Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"ParkingGuaranteed\", \"Yes\");\n    } else {\n        Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"ParkingGuaranteed\", \"No\");\n    }\n\n\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID30","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q30","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID30"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID31","SecondaryAttribute":"Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely cho...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin-top: 10px;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: #f4f6f7; border-bottom: 2px solid #cccccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Vanpool<\/span><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">(e-)Bicycle<\/span><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">Public Transport<\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">Time (minutes)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID21\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">Total travel allowance<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">\u20ac 0.00&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">\u20ac 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q31","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely cho...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID31"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID32","SecondaryAttribute":"Example commute choice \u00a0 Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part o..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><br \/>\nExample commute choice<\/h1>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part of the survey. It shows how different commute options are compared.<\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\nYou do not need to make a choice here yet.<\/p>\n\n<h2><br \/>\nImportant note<\/h2>\n<br \/>\nPlease keep in mind that<strong><em> the table does not include every possible cost or benefit associated with each travel option<\/em><\/strong>. For example, fuel costs are not shown. When choosing options like the vanpool, you may save money on fuel or other personal travel expenses, even though these are not displayed in the table.<br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Car<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>P+R<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID15\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${e:\/\/Field\/PR_time} min <span title=\"This time represents your Commuter allowance time from your home address to your ASML work location. It includes your trip from home to the P+R location and from the P+R location to work.\"> <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Commuter allowance<br \/>\n\t\t\t(one way)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">&euro; 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\tcost<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">- &euro; 1.50<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\treservation<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span title=\"No reservation system in place.\">None <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><span title=\"No reservation system in place.\">None <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\tguaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">No<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">Yes<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">P+R<br \/>\n\t\t\treward<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ &euro; 1.50<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<br \/>\nFor the exact definitions of the transport modes and variables, you can click the tab below:<br \/>\n&nbsp;\n<h3><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" id=\"moreInfoToggle\" style=\"font-weight:600;\">Click here for more information \u25bc <\/a><\/h3>\n\n<div id=\"moreInfoContent\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px;\">\n<p><strong>Transport modes in the table<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>The transport mode shown in the table refers to the main part of your commute, meaning the mode you use for the longest or most important part of the trip to campus.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Car:<\/strong> Traveling mainly by private car for the commute.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>P+R:<\/strong> Driving to a Park and Ride location outside campus and continuing to campus by shuttle service or electric bicycle. In this survey, Park and Ride refers specifically to P+R Koningshof.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Public transport:<\/strong> Traveling mainly by scheduled public transport, such as bus or train. This includes any walking or cycling needed to reach or leave stops or stations.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Fixed characteristics<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>These characteristics are based on the information you provided earlier in the survey. They stay the same within a table and across questions.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Time:<\/strong> The estimated time from your home to campus for each commute option. This estimate is based on your earlier answers.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Commuter allowance (one way):<\/strong> The commuting reimbursement you receive for traveling by car or bicycle. This amount is calculated using the distance you provided earlier.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Variable characteristics<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>These characteristics differ between commute options and may also change from one question to another. They describe differences in costs, conditions, or additional benefits.<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Parking cost:<\/strong> The amount you pay for parking per day when choosing this option. If the value is negative, this means you pay that amount per day.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Parking reservation:<\/strong> Indicates whether and how you can reserve a parking space in advance. &ldquo;None&rdquo; means no reservation is available. &ldquo;Priority system&rdquo; means commuters living more than 20 km away can reserve one week in advance, while those living 20 km or closer can reserve 24 hours in advance. &ldquo;Standard system&rdquo; means everyone can reserve one week in advance.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>Parking guaranteed:<\/strong> Indicates whether a parking space is guaranteed when you arrive. If parking is not guaranteed, availability may vary and you may need to search for parking.<\/li>\n\t<li><strong>P+R reward:<\/strong> The financial reward you receive for choosing the Park and Ride option.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Example commute choice \u00a0 Below is an example of the type of table you will see in the next part o...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<h2>Explanation of the experiment<\/h2>\nThe experiment is all about making&nbsp;<em>hypothetical&nbsp;<\/em>&nbsp;commute choices when you have different options to choose from.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn this hypothetical scenario, the starting point for your choice is that you must travel to campus on the busiest days of the week, Tuesday and Thursday.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn the tables, you are presented with different commute options for how to commute to campus. All of the choices have their pros and cons time-wise and cost-wise. Choose the commute option you like best when you compare the options with each other.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe commute options presented are generic and do not apply to your specific travel needs, so you have to imagine all the presented options are a possibility for you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nNote: keep in mind these are&nbsp;<em>hypothetical commute options<\/em>, and they might differ from policies and rewards that are now in place within ASML.","DataExportTag":"Q32","QuestionID":"QID32","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n\n  var toggle = document.getElementById(\"moreInfoToggle\");\n  var content = document.getElementById(\"moreInfoContent\");\n\n  if (toggle && content) {\n    toggle.onclick = function() {\n      if (content.style.display === \"none\") {\n        content.style.display = \"block\";\n        toggle.innerHTML = \"More information \u25b2\";\n      } else {\n        content.style.display = \"none\";\n        toggle.innerHTML = \"More information \u25bc\";\n      }\n    };\n  }\n\n});\n\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID33","SecondaryAttribute":"Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely cho...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin-top: 10px;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: #f4f6f7; border-bottom: 2px solid #cccccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Car<\/span><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">P&amp;R<\/span><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">Public Transport<\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">Time (minutes)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID15\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${e:\/\/Field\/new_time}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">Total travel allowance<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center;\">\u20ac 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely cho...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50;\"><strong>Vanpool<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#2c3e50;\"><strong>(e-)Bicycle<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Public Transport<\/strong><\/h3>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Time<\/h4>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID21\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span id=\"cke_bm_10807C\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;<\/span>&nbsp;${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DataExportTag":"Q33","QuestionID":"QID33"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID34","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q34","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID34"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID35","SecondaryAttribute":"On a typical work day, how many minutes does it take you to travel to the P+R Koningshof from you...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"On a typical work day, how many <b>minutes <\/b>does it take you to travel to the<b> P+R Koningshof<\/b> from your home address, <i>including your usual traffic<\/i>?&nbsp;<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIf you are not sure, an estimation is fine.<br \/>\n\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe image below shows the location of the P+R relative to the ASML campus.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<img src=\"https:\/\/survey.asml.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_tnH3101gxGZYw1q\" style=\"width: 1546px; height: 844px;\" \/><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><em>Note: This time includes <strong>only<\/strong> the trip from your home address to the P+R. It does <strong>not<\/strong> include the time from the Park and Ride location to campus.<\/em><\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q35","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"On a typical work day, how many minutes does it take you to travel to the P+R Koningshof from you...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"ContentType","ContentType":"ValidNumber","ValidDateType":"DateWithFormat","ValidPhoneType":"ValidUSPhone","ValidZipType":"ValidUSZip","ValidNumber":{"Min":"0","Max":"","NumDecimals":""},"AITextAnalysis":{"Checks":[{"Messages":"default","Type":"Partial"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"OverlyGeneralized"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"NonInsightful"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"InsufficientDetail"},{"Messages":"default","Type":"Gibberish"}]}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionID":"QID35","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID12\/SelectableChoice\/1\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">In a typical work week, how often do you commute using each of the following transport modes to t...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Car \/ motorbike + park at ASML campus - 0x a week<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID12\/SelectableChoice\/1\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID12","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID12","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"1":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID12\/SelectableChoice\/2\/1","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">In a typical work week, how often do you commute using each of the following transport modes to t...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Car \/ motorbike + park at P+R - 0x a week<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID12\/SelectableChoice\/2\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID12","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID12","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"2":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID18\/SelectableChoice\/4","Conjuction":"Or","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">Or<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Do you have a car available for your commute to ASML, regardless of your actual use of car?<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">No, (almost) never<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID18\/SelectableChoice\/4","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID18","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID18","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function () {\n\n  const q = this.questionContainer;\n  const input = q.querySelector('input[type=\"text\"]');\n  if (!input) return;\n\n  \/* ----- outer wrapper (vertical layout) ----- *\/\n  const outer = document.createElement('div');\n  outer.style.display = 'flex';\n  outer.style.flexDirection = 'column';\n  outer.style.alignItems = 'flex-start';\n\n  input.parentNode.insertBefore(outer, input);\n\n  \/* ----- row for input + unit ----- *\/\n  const row = document.createElement('div');\n  row.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n  row.style.alignItems = 'center';\n  row.style.gap = '8px';\n\n  outer.appendChild(row);\n  row.appendChild(input);\n\n  const unit = document.createElement('span');\n  unit.textContent = 'minutes'; \/\/ change if needed\n  unit.style.fontSize = '14px';\n\n  row.appendChild(unit);\n\n  \/* ----- note BELOW the answer box ----- *\/\n  const note = document.createElement('div');\n  note.textContent = 'Enter a single number (for example: 15).';\n  note.style.fontSize = '12px';\n  note.style.color = '#555';\n  note.style.marginTop = '6px';\n\n  outer.appendChild(note);\n});\n\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID36","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 In the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical wa.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><br \/>\nInstructions&nbsp;<\/h1>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\">a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n<\/style>\nIn the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical ways of commuting to campus. Each question shows several options that vary in travel time, costs, and conditions, and you should imagine that all options apply directly to you. For every choice, assume you are commuting on the busiest days of the week: Tuesday and Thursday. Compare the options in each table and select the one you would most often choose under typical busy weekday conditions.<\/p>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<h2>Important note<\/h2>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;<\/h2>\nAll commute options in this survey are hypothetical. They may differ from current policies, facilities, or rewards that exist at ASML.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\nOn the next page, you will first see an example to show how the commute options are presented.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q36","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 In the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical wa...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID36"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID37","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 In the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical wa.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><br \/>\nInstructions&nbsp;<\/h1>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\">a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n<\/style>\nIn the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical ways of commuting to campus. Each question shows several options that vary in travel time, costs, and conditions, and you should imagine that all options apply directly to you. For every choice, assume you are commuting on the busiest days of the week: Tuesday and Thursday. Compare the options in each table and select the one you would most often choose under typical busy weekday conditions.<\/p>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<h2>Important note<\/h2>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n<p>All commute options in this survey are hypothetical. They may differ from current policies, facilities, or rewards that exist at ASML.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\nOn the next page, you will first see an example to show how the commute options are presented.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q37","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 In the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical wa...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID37"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID38","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions\u00a0 \u00a0 In the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical wa.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1><br \/>\nInstructions&nbsp;<\/h1>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\">a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n<\/style>\nIn the next part of the survey, you will choose between different hypothetical ways of commuting to campus. Each question shows several options that vary in travel time, costs, and conditions, and you should imagine that all options apply directly to you. For every choice, assume you are commuting on the busiest days of the week: Tuesday and Thursday. Compare the options in each table and select the one you would most often choose under typical busy weekday conditions.<\/p>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n<h2>Important note<\/h2>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;<\/h2>\nAll commute options in this survey are hypothetical. They may differ from current policies, facilities, or rewards that exist at ASML.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/