xt","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q6","QuestionType":"Meta","Selector":"Browser","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Browser","TextEntry":1},"2":{"Display":"Version","TextEntry":1},"3":{"Display":"Operating System","TextEntry":1},"4":{"Display":"Screen Resolution","TextEntry":1},"5":{"Display":"Flash Version","TextEntry":1},"6":{"Display":"Java Support","TextEntry":1},"7":{"Display":"User Agent","TextEntry":1}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID6"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID60","SecondaryAttribute":"(2) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>(2)<\/strong> Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Car<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>P+R<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><b>Vanpool<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><b>Public Transport<\/b><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>(e)-Bicycle<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID15\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${e:\/\/Field\/PR_time} min <span title=\"This time represents your Commuter allowance time from your home address to your ASML work location. It includes your trip from home to the P+R location and from the P+R location to work.\"> <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/vp_time} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Commuter allowance<br \/>\n\t\t\t(one way)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/bike_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\tcost<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">- &euro; 1.50<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\treservation<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span title=\"No reservation system in place.\">None <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><span title=\"No reservation system in place.\">None <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\tguaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">No<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">Yes<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">P+R<br \/>\n\t\t\treward<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ &euro; 1.50<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Emergency<br \/>\n\t\t\ttaxi guaranteed<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">Yes<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Vanpool<br \/>\n\t\t\tdepartures<br \/>\n\t\t\tper hour<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">4x per hour<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q60","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"(2) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID60"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID61","SecondaryAttribute":"Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?","DataExportTag":"Q61","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Based on the above scenario, which transport mode would you choose?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Car"},"2":{"Display":"P+R"},"3":{"Display":"Vanpool"},"4":{"Display":"Public Transport"},"5":{"Display":"(e)-Bicycle"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID61"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3mhzO8uLuQDB9no","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID62","SecondaryAttribute":"Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer. If you accept this offer, you give up your...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Now imagine ASML makes the following <strong>voluntary offer.<\/strong><br>\n<br>\nIf you accept this offer, you give up your <strong>right to park on the ASML campus for 4 years<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nYou will <strong>still be allowed to park at all Park and Ride (P+R) locations!<\/strong>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>In return, you can choose <strong>one of the following&nbsp;<\/strong>rewards:<\/p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>A free <b>e\u2011bike<\/b> worth \u20ac2,000<\/li>\n\t<li>A free home <b>EV charging station<\/b><\/li>\n\t<li><b>Unlimited <\/b>public transport (including private trips)<\/li>\n\t<li>\u20ac2,000 <b>cash <\/b>(gross<b>)<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<div><br>\nBased on the <b>same scenario shown in the table above,<\/b> would you accept this offer?<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q62","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Now imagine ASML makes the following voluntary offer. If you accept this offer, you give up your...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"InPageDisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID61\/Selectable