D92","SecondaryAttribute":"(21) Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likel...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><strong>(21)<\/strong> Assuming conditions on busiest weekdays, please indicate which travel option you would likely choose most regularly:<\/p>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; max-width:700px; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; margin-top:10px; white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color:#e8e8e8; border-bottom:2px solid #ccc;\">\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">&nbsp;<\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>Car<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><strong>P+R<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>Vanpool<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\"><strong>Public Transport<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t\t<th style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><strong>(e)-Bicycle<\/strong><\/th>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #ddd;\">\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Time<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID15\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${e:\/\/Field\/PR_time} min <span title=\"This time represents your Commuter allowance time from your home address to your ASML work location. It includes your trip from home to the P+R location and from the P+R location to work.\"> <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(\u2139)<\/i> <\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/vp_time} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">${q:\/\/QID17\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${q:\/\/QID16\/ChoiceTextEntryValue} min<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Commuter allowance<br \/>\n\t\t\t(one way)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">+ ${e:\/\/Field\/car_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00 (NS business card)<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\">${e:\/\/Field\/bike_allowance}<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\tcost<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- &euro; 1.50<\/span><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&euro; 0.00<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f7;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">&nbsp;<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; background-color:#f0f0f0;\">Parking<br \/>\n\t\t\treservation<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"padding:10px; text-align:center; background-color:#ffffff;\"><span title=\"Reservations open from 1 week in advance for everyone.\">Standard system <i style=\"margin-left:3px; cursor:help; font-size:11px;\">(